  "description": "The description of the proposal can be summarised as below: \n\nTriangular dormer to be removed at Roof level above 2F bedroom\nSingle wide dormer in 2F bedroom to be replaced by 2 separate dormers with sliding sash windows to align with floor below\nAll external handrails to be changed from franless glass to traditional metal railings (Roof terrace, 2F outside dormers, GF Terrace outside kitchen and bottom of garden near the site boundary) \nBedroom and staircase at 2F redesigned to allow stair accessed from the hallway to the roof terrace above \nAC added to the bedrooms (External units on the roof terrace above 2F from 2F - not visible from anywhere except from the roof)\nSecondary glazing added throughout all windows (with exception of the kitchen and lower ground)\n1F toilet to be used as a storage cupboard and 1F bathroom layout altered (all of this is of a previous modern renovation currently)\nChange the GF Terrace (outside living room/kitchen) from being Structural Glass to a solid floor/roof construction. )This will help with the overheating of lower ground floor also.)\nRedundant hot water panels removed from roof. \nPond at the front courtyard removed and landscaped as a garden (to be safer) ",
